<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35731" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνίσσω</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		 collat. form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνίπτω,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>attack, reproach,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπάγλοις ἐπέεσσιν ἐνισσέμεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					15.198
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀνειδείοισιν ἐνίσσων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					22.497
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔπεσσ᾽ αἰσχροῖσιν ἐνίσσων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					24.238
				</span></i>
			: also generally, <i>maltreal,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔπεσίν τε κακοῖσιν ἐνίσσομεν ἠδὲ
					βολῇσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					24.161
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαλλόμενος καὶ
			ἐνισσόμενος</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				163
			</span></i>.</div>
